WEBVTT

01:28.610 --> 01:29.730
KNOW

01:33.050 --> 01:36.020
LOVE

01:45.000 --> 01:50.280
Musashi, you've made progress,
but you're still not at my level!

01:50.720 --> 01:51.920
What?

01:52.600 --> 01:55.320
You bring shame to the demon gun!

02:08.080 --> 02:11.790
Kojiro Sasaki is really strong.
Has she always been like this?

02:12.000 --> 02:13.200
Yes.

02:13.280 --> 02:18.760
I sounds like they already fought before.
Musashi already lost to her?

02:18.960 --> 02:20.160
Yes.

02:20.520 --> 02:24.480
Then Musashi has no hope of beating her?

02:24.640 --> 02:29.950
He does. Musashi has not
yet used all of his strength.

02:30.360 --> 02:34.070
Musashi has a good chance of
winning if he concentrates.

02:35.440 --> 02:37.830
But Musashi is chivalrous towards women.

02:38.040 --> 02:39.240
Yes.

02:46.280 --> 02:48.400
Kojiro Sasaki?

02:48.560 --> 02:55.510
Before Musashi appeared, I believed that
she would be the savior of the world.

02:55.880 --> 02:59.560
Was I right?

02:59.760 --> 03:01.030
Or...

03:02.360 --> 03:07.070
Now, it matters little which
of the two is the savior.

03:07.240 --> 03:11.920
After all, her role is to unite the seven artifacts.

03:12.080 --> 03:13.910
She is nothing more than a tool.

03:14.310 --> 03:17.240
OSAKA CASTLE

03:19.840 --> 03:21.910
Don't skimp on the back!

03:26.040 --> 03:29.870
Even Musashi will be unable to do
anything with such surveillance!

03:30.080 --> 03:34.590
Then again, we have already faced
him in a castle robbing competition.

03:34.920 --> 03:37.390
We know his limits well!

03:37.560 --> 03:40.840
We have nothing to fear
from Musashi Miyamoto!

03:41.640 --> 03:45.470
Our opponent is a professional
thief. Remain vigilant.

03:46.080 --> 03:48.280
Don't forget that he is not alone.

03:48.920 --> 03:52.240
There is that samurai with no
master who calls himself Ronin.

03:52.720 --> 03:57.560
There is also Princess Kaguya,
Yume, and maybe Sasuke.

03:58.080 --> 04:02.790
That's impossible! Sarutobi
is one of Sanada Ten Braves!

04:03.320 --> 04:04.590
He's right!

04:04.760 --> 04:08.070
It is unthinkable that Sasuke would betray you!

04:08.600 --> 04:11.270
But what is betrayal?

04:11.440 --> 04:13.800
What is justice?

04:14.360 --> 04:17.430
And what is the point of this fight?

04:18.320 --> 04:20.360
I'm questioning everything.

04:22.920 --> 04:33.110
Despite all our efforts, we did not even reach
to the castles where the artifacts were located.

04:33.720 --> 04:38.510
But Musashi and his friends
instead obtained six artifacts...

04:38.680 --> 04:42.720
and are about to get the
last one. Why is that?

04:42.920 --> 04:44.120
Well...

04:45.000 --> 04:46.910
Somewhere...

04:47.080 --> 04:49.750
someone is pulling the strings of this story.

04:51.880 --> 04:57.320
Whoever it is will influence the battle to come.

04:57.480 --> 05:00.630
In other words, we do
not know what lies ahead.

05:00.800 --> 05:02.000
Get ready.

05:07.840 --> 05:09.510
No, no and no!

05:09.680 --> 05:15.110
When you paint the sky and the clouds,
you have to give firmer strokes!

05:15.320 --> 05:17.070
I understand.
Like that?

05:17.760 --> 05:22.360
That's right. It's a pity that
you will be a general.

05:22.760 --> 05:25.040
Don't you want to become my disciple?

05:25.760 --> 05:28.270
I thank you, but...

05:28.440 --> 05:31.240
It's completely impossible!

05:31.640 --> 05:32.740
Mitsunari.

05:32.760 --> 05:38.830
Mr. Leonardo Kuma, don't try to mislead
the general from the straight path!

05:39.360 --> 05:46.590
If I were Leonardo Kuma, I would
throw rubber bands in your face.

05:48.200 --> 05:50.240
Nothing, I'm talking to myself...

05:50.880 --> 05:59.510
The actors of Utopia who were disciples of Leonardo
Kuma are known only to the people of the future.

06:00.400 --> 06:02.710
Have I gone too far?

06:02.880 --> 06:04.950
What are you talking about?

06:05.120 --> 06:06.790
Sorry, I didn't say anything.

06:07.520 --> 06:10.880
Lord, we are ready to fight.

06:11.040 --> 06:13.480
Osaka Castle will not fall!

06:14.000 --> 06:15.400
Is that what worries you?

06:15.880 --> 06:17.470
What do you mean?

06:17.640 --> 06:23.830
Our thief's goal is not
to take over the castle.

06:24.000 --> 06:25.200
What?

06:25.440 --> 06:28.430
What does that mean, Mr. da Vinci?

06:28.600 --> 06:31.510
Why is Musashi invading the castle then?

06:31.880 --> 06:33.630
That is not his goal.

06:34.720 --> 06:39.190
What? Is someone else other
than Musashi coming?

06:39.720 --> 06:45.880
It will be him, on the surface. But someone
behind the scenes is pulling the strings.

06:46.040 --> 06:48.790
And his goal is not to take over the castle.

06:49.200 --> 06:53.320
Who is pulling the strings?
What is the goal?

06:53.680 --> 06:54.880
You will see.

06:57.840 --> 06:59.350
Flammable bullet!

07:00.920 --> 07:04.600
The demon gun should be more powerful!

07:05.600 --> 07:09.070
Don't act like you know!
You don't have it!

07:09.520 --> 07:15.720
I don't have it, of course, but I
know its power better than anyone!

07:16.320 --> 07:18.910
Spare me your arrogance!

07:21.160 --> 07:22.910
Ring of fire bullet!

07:24.640 --> 07:25.780
It worked!

07:25.800 --> 07:30.200
I see you've made progress, but not much.

07:30.400 --> 07:31.600
Say that again!

07:37.520 --> 07:41.550
Musashi's attacks are starting to work.

07:41.720 --> 07:42.860
Yes.

07:42.880 --> 07:45.390
It seems that his <i>"engine"</i> is finally superheated.

07:45.520 --> 07:46.720
Yes.

07:46.760 --> 07:47.900
"<i>Engine</i>"?

07:47.920 --> 07:50.070
It means "motor".

07:50.520 --> 07:57.870
Ronin, do you always give your approval to
everyone just to say "yes" as much as possible?

07:58.080 --> 07:59.350
Yes.

08:03.280 --> 08:04.480
Yasha?

08:04.760 --> 08:05.960
No.

08:06.120 --> 08:08.840
It's Urashima, Yasha's doppelganger.

08:09.400 --> 08:12.790
Musashi Miyamoto, Kojiro Sasaki.

08:13.040 --> 08:21.470
I understand you wanna settle this,
but could you grant me a cease-fire?

08:21.680 --> 08:22.880
Why?

08:23.080 --> 08:24.280
Explain.

08:24.760 --> 08:26.560
It is time.

08:26.720 --> 08:30.920
The time has come to unite the seven artifacts.

08:32.280 --> 08:34.840
Unite the seven artifacts...

08:35.000 --> 08:38.990
Does that mean we will imprison the ayakashi?

08:39.160 --> 08:44.190
I haven't seen many ayakashi around lately.

08:45.000 --> 08:47.830
- Does that even make sense?
- Of course.

08:48.800 --> 08:50.200
How come?

08:52.320 --> 08:55.120
If you want to see it, all you
have to do is follow me.

08:58.280 --> 09:00.430
Musashi, what are you going to do?

09:00.640 --> 09:04.080
It's completely obvious!
Isn't that right, Ronin?

09:04.440 --> 09:06.110
- Yes.
- Yes.

09:06.280 --> 09:08.030
- Yes.
- Yes.

09:11.600 --> 09:13.880
Everyone wants to come.

09:14.640 --> 09:16.230
Kojiro, aren't you coming?

09:16.840 --> 09:20.070
Did you really think I would come?

09:26.840 --> 09:30.040
She puts on airs until the end.

09:30.560 --> 09:34.680
Musashi, you still have to
train to hope you can beat me.

09:34.880 --> 09:36.080
What?

09:36.280 --> 09:42.110
I would have liked to beat you and
then have a good meal with you.

09:42.640 --> 09:44.200
We'll leave that for next time.

09:44.400 --> 09:46.760
Who would want to eat with you?

09:46.960 --> 09:49.430
Why are you so adamant?

09:49.960 --> 09:53.270
I would have invited you to
eat your beloved grilled eels.

09:53.480 --> 09:54.680
Grilled eels?

09:55.760 --> 09:59.310
Goodbye.
Next time, I will beat you...

09:59.480 --> 10:06.150
and you will accept my proposal. And finally, we will eat eels together.

10:09.200 --> 10:12.030
Nonsense!
You will never beat me!

10:12.640 --> 10:14.280
Kojiro Sasaki...

10:15.000 --> 10:17.560
I still hate you!

10:18.280 --> 10:22.480
But what is Kojiro's proposal?

10:22.640 --> 10:25.390
I can't tell you.

10:25.560 --> 10:28.710
My dear Ronin!
Tell me!

10:28.880 --> 10:32.270
Kojiro Sasaki asked to marry Musashi!

10:32.640 --> 10:34.390
She asked to marry him?

10:34.720 --> 10:38.030
Did Sasaki ask Musashi to marry her?

10:38.200 --> 10:40.760
You idiot, not so loud!

10:40.960 --> 10:42.280
Ronin, you traitor!

10:42.480 --> 10:45.280
I'm sorry, it slipped out!
Sorry!

10:45.440 --> 10:46.950
What are you doing?

10:47.160 --> 10:48.360
Let's go.

10:54.600 --> 10:57.880
Are Musashi and his
friends really coming?

10:58.240 --> 11:00.310
- I don't know.
- They're coming!

11:07.600 --> 11:08.800
Where are we?

11:09.000 --> 11:10.140
This...

11:10.160 --> 11:12.960
Isn't that Osaka Castle?

11:13.760 --> 11:20.280
Musashi, let's infiltrate the castle and go
to the room of the late General Hideyoshi.

11:20.720 --> 11:25.160
We will practice the artifact unification ritual.

11:25.360 --> 11:26.710
Wait a minute!

11:26.920 --> 11:28.100
What is it?

11:28.120 --> 11:29.710
Your tele-whatever...

11:30.200 --> 11:31.710
Teleportation?

11:32.200 --> 11:43.190
Yes, if you are able to teleport, why don't
you take us directly to Hideyoshi's room?

11:43.720 --> 11:47.920
Yes. Infiltrating the castle
seems complicated to me.

11:48.360 --> 11:52.510
I would like to but circumstances
prevent me from doing so.

11:52.720 --> 11:53.920
What circumstances?

11:54.720 --> 11:57.000
This is the <i>climax</i> of the series.

11:57.160 --> 12:03.310
The viewer expects violent fight scenes and emotionally charged scenes...

12:03.480 --> 12:06.520
I don't understand anything you say.

12:06.680 --> 12:11.510
You'll have to show your castle-robbing
talents for the last episode.

12:15.880 --> 12:16.820
Ready?

12:16.840 --> 12:18.040
Yes!

12:18.640 --> 12:20.360
You don't have to follow me!

12:21.040 --> 12:24.240
You don't all have a reason to be here.

12:24.440 --> 12:25.640
Yes.

12:25.720 --> 12:28.440
I am Musashi Miyamoto, the castle thief!

12:28.840 --> 12:31.040
I will take over Osaka Castle!

12:31.240 --> 12:33.150
I am Ronin, the same thing!

12:41.720 --> 12:42.740
Musashi!

12:42.760 --> 12:44.640
Princess, don't go in there!

12:44.800 --> 12:50.550
You'll get yourself killed!
Besides, it's already your castle!

12:50.720 --> 12:52.630
I don't care!

12:52.800 --> 12:55.550
My destiny is to protect Musashi!

12:57.200 --> 12:58.470
Princess Yume!

12:58.640 --> 12:59.840
Master Sasuke!

13:00.320 --> 13:03.550
You're a soldier of Yukimura Sanada!

13:03.720 --> 13:08.550
Invading this castle is tantamount
to turning against Yukimura!

13:09.960 --> 13:14.510
My heart is with Ninjataro,
disciple of Musashi!

13:16.800 --> 13:18.470
What a pain...

13:18.640 --> 13:20.600
This stuff does not concern me.

13:20.960 --> 13:23.600
But I have a right to see...

13:23.760 --> 13:25.560
what will happen...

13:25.760 --> 13:27.560
when the artifacts are reunited.

13:28.160 --> 13:32.880
Danjo, you must convince
Mitsunari to cease the attacks.

13:33.040 --> 13:34.310
What about you?

13:35.040 --> 13:38.350
Why ask a question you know the answer for?

13:38.840 --> 13:41.200
Please forgive me.

13:44.240 --> 13:45.990
They are all gone.

13:46.160 --> 13:49.520
I'm lonely and bored.

13:49.620 --> 13:52.590
EDO CASTLE

13:53.160 --> 13:55.800
You saw, I am good!

13:56.280 --> 13:59.800
Lord Ieyasu, you are good, you are great!

14:00.760 --> 14:02.190
I'm bored.

14:02.680 --> 14:05.190
Lord Ieyasu!

14:05.840 --> 14:08.480
You are great, you are great!

14:08.640 --> 14:13.480
I should have asked Dabinoji
to make him smarter.

14:15.200 --> 14:17.950
I should have gone with Dabi-Dabi!

14:20.240 --> 14:23.760
What the hell is going on?

14:24.080 --> 14:25.720
Goodbye, young man!

14:33.480 --> 14:34.710
Where are we?

14:36.720 --> 14:41.270
It's Lord Hideyoshi's room.

14:43.200 --> 14:44.400
Let's get started.

14:45.160 --> 14:46.360
What do I do?

14:52.400 --> 14:53.600
This symbol...

14:53.640 --> 14:54.840
A pentacle...

14:55.360 --> 14:57.800
It's a magical Yin-Yang symbol.

14:58.520 --> 14:59.720
It is time.

14:59.840 --> 15:03.360
The time has come to imprison all the ayakashi.

15:03.760 --> 15:06.830
Place the artifacts in the center.

15:11.280 --> 15:13.320
Wait, Musashi.

15:14.360 --> 15:17.910
I need to ask Urashima something first.

15:18.520 --> 15:19.720
What is it?

15:19.880 --> 15:24.950
Will you take off that mask
and show us your face?

15:26.520 --> 15:28.960
Urashima, are you our...

15:29.560 --> 15:32.710
I refuse!
Let's begin the ritual!

15:32.920 --> 15:36.710
THE MOON FLOATS

15:36.880 --> 15:40.160
IN THE DARK SKY

15:40.760 --> 15:46.870
SHROUDING MY BELOVED CREATIONS

15:47.560 --> 15:50.840
I'm in pain!
Stop it!

15:51.720 --> 15:53.120
Ronin, please!

15:53.840 --> 15:55.270
Take off Urashima's mask!

15:55.480 --> 15:56.680
All right!

16:04.000 --> 16:07.230
I knew it.
It's you, mother.

16:07.440 --> 16:08.670
Mother?

16:12.040 --> 16:13.270
What do you mean?

16:18.760 --> 16:21.430
All the main characters are gathered.

16:21.920 --> 16:25.600
Old Dabinoji?
But what does this mean?

16:26.040 --> 16:28.790
I will explain everything.

16:28.960 --> 16:30.870
But the episode is almost over.

16:31.040 --> 16:34.480
We must first deal with the artifact ritual.

16:35.080 --> 16:36.990
But Mr. Dabinoji.

16:37.520 --> 16:38.920
Never mind.

16:39.080 --> 16:42.960
Let your mother do as she wishes.

16:50.880 --> 16:53.520
<i>Rin! Pyo! To! Sha!</i>

16:53.680 --> 16:56.640
<i>Kai! Jin! Retsu! Zai! Zen!</i>

17:03.440 --> 17:04.950
It looks like...

17:05.120 --> 17:06.320
A coffin!

17:06.560 --> 17:10.470
That's right!
It's Mr. Hideyoshi's coffin.

17:11.040 --> 17:12.470
Hideyoshi Toyotomi?

17:23.600 --> 17:25.880
- A buddha?
- A mummy?

17:26.600 --> 17:28.830
It is the mummy of Hideyoshi Toyotomi.

17:29.320 --> 17:30.520
Look at his hand!

17:30.840 --> 17:32.240
The demon gun!

17:32.840 --> 17:39.200
It's the heaven gun that Mitsuhide Akechi
said was supposed to be on the Moon.

17:39.400 --> 17:42.230
Then what is it doing here?

17:42.880 --> 17:49.110
I'm the one who took it from
the Moon for Mr. Hideyoshi!

17:49.680 --> 17:51.080
What does that mean?

17:51.560 --> 17:57.030
The Moon sorceress and mother of Kaguya and Yume had a forbidden love.

17:57.720 --> 17:58.920
Forbidden love?

17:59.560 --> 18:03.950
Love between a Moon sorceress
and a human is forbidden.

18:04.120 --> 18:08.400
Although there have already been many precedents.

18:10.760 --> 18:14.880
Each has resulted in a tragedy
and distortion of history...

18:15.040 --> 18:20.480
to the point that the Moon
and Earth had to separate.

18:22.280 --> 18:27.990
But that did not stop Kaguya and
Yume's mother from loving Hideyoshi.

18:28.200 --> 18:29.400
Then...

18:29.840 --> 18:32.150
Kaguya and Yume's father...

18:33.240 --> 18:35.390
It's Lord Hideyoshi.

18:35.600 --> 18:39.670
How? Would they then be his
daughters by blood and not adopted?

18:40.480 --> 18:48.150
Hideyoshi had the idea of harnessing
the magical powers of the one he loved.

18:48.320 --> 18:54.320
In particular her gift of teleporting
through time and space.

18:55.280 --> 18:57.870
He had her bring back objects...

18:58.040 --> 19:00.600
that did not exist in our time...

19:01.080 --> 19:03.550
such as pistols, rifles...

19:03.720 --> 19:07.480
machine guns and more.

19:10.280 --> 19:17.630
She didn't want her lover to
hate her so she did all he asked.

19:19.840 --> 19:29.590
But each time she did so, a space-time
distortion would occur, changing history.

19:30.520 --> 19:35.400
And that is when one of
those space-time distortions...

19:35.560 --> 19:39.240
opened the parallel dimension
in which Haruaki Abe...

19:39.400 --> 19:43.550
had imprisoned the ayakashi
a thousand years ago.

19:44.840 --> 19:50.200
At the same time, something
else happened to our mother.

19:50.880 --> 19:54.190
The evil that took root in her heart...

19:54.360 --> 20:00.040
merged with a resurrected ayakashi,
giving birth to her alter ego Yasha.

20:00.600 --> 20:02.670
Mother and Yasha fought each other...

20:02.840 --> 20:04.040
and Yasha...

20:05.000 --> 20:06.640
came out victorious.

20:06.840 --> 20:09.310
Yasha later became leader of the ayakashi.

20:10.040 --> 20:15.640
Yasha would have liked to harness
the powers of the moon sorceresses...

20:15.800 --> 20:19.790
by marrying Ieyasu Tokugawa
and Princess Kaguya.

20:20.280 --> 20:23.750
As Mr. Hideyoshi had previously done.

20:23.960 --> 20:29.070
However, Yasha was again imprisoned
by our resurrected mother.

20:29.960 --> 20:33.030
Mother, what are you trying to do?

20:33.200 --> 20:42.880
Now that Yasha and the ayakashi are gone,
there's no use in gathering the artifacts.

20:43.680 --> 20:46.400
You do not understand anything!

20:47.520 --> 20:50.750
You do not understand why I have done this!

20:50.920 --> 20:55.120
If I have deceived and betrayed so many people...

20:56.080 --> 20:57.280
It's because of that!

21:08.920 --> 21:10.430
The artifacts are glowing!

21:10.600 --> 21:11.800
His body!

21:14.520 --> 21:15.840
Dear!

21:20.320 --> 21:22.880
Hideyoshi, I longed to see you again!

21:23.720 --> 21:27.990
I suffered excruciatingly from
being away from you for so long!

21:30.000 --> 21:32.040
- Mother.
- Dear Mother.

21:34.800 --> 21:38.190
If Urashima wanted to
bring the artifacts together...

21:39.080 --> 21:42.280
Was it to resurrect her lover Hideyoshi?

21:42.480 --> 21:43.680
Yes.

21:50.840 --> 21:52.070
I see.

21:52.480 --> 21:54.790
Do you want my demon gun?

21:59.560 --> 22:03.790
Anyone who doesn't have both guns goes crazy.

22:03.960 --> 22:05.600
That's why he wants it.

22:06.720 --> 22:09.360
- Master Musashi!
- Musashi!

22:20.600 --> 22:23.040
I'll give you this gun, Hideyoshi.

22:23.200 --> 22:24.400
Are you sure?

22:25.680 --> 22:29.360
My shoulder hurts from holding it.

22:29.840 --> 22:35.240
If Hideyoshi turns into a demon,
his men will be in serious trouble

22:35.840 --> 22:37.040
Master Musashi.

22:44.120 --> 22:46.630
What is happening to his body?

22:46.800 --> 22:48.000
It's rotting!

22:48.280 --> 22:50.160
Why?

22:50.800 --> 22:53.760
The artifacts' power is too weak.

22:53.920 --> 22:59.790
Or God doesn't want history to
become even more distorted.

23:02.200 --> 23:04.670
Dear! Dear!

23:05.360 --> 23:07.240
Goodbye, father.

23:07.640 --> 23:08.840
Father.

23:12.120 --> 23:15.110
Dear sister, I am leaving now.

23:15.800 --> 23:17.000
Take care of yourself.

23:17.280 --> 23:19.640
Where did Dabinoji go?

23:20.320 --> 23:24.560
He must have gone off into the future
with Ryogen to form a comedy duet.

23:25.200 --> 23:26.400
A comedy duet?

23:26.720 --> 23:28.040
That's absurd.

23:28.600 --> 23:34.590
Master Musashi, don't jeopardize
public order by robbing castles, please.

23:34.800 --> 23:36.390
I make no promises.

23:37.040 --> 23:42.360
If you go too far, Mitsunari Ishida
will send men on your trail.

23:42.720 --> 23:45.470
I will have no choice but to run like hell!

23:46.880 --> 23:49.680
Take care of Yume, please.

23:49.840 --> 23:51.140
I gladly will!

25:30.520 --> 25:32.160
Is that so?

25:32.200 --> 25:35.480
Musashi, come to our rescue.

25:36.640 --> 25:37.840
Quickly!

25:38.600 --> 25:39.870
Come to our aid!

25:39.870 --> 25:45.020
BOX SET 1    EARTH
